  "S10_artifact_and_data_reliance": [
    "Codex filtered170 log claims5filled fields; saved JSON contains4nonnull fields. Original-A/B sums17 each match; filtered actual22 differs from logged23. Preserve this dated discrepancy rather than rewriting an immutable observation without a model/source/run hash. Counts measure filling, not verified accuracy.",
