    "Ten numeric/boolean API field comparisons vary across identical-school variants. Null vs false must remain unknown vs explicit no; positive admission flags cannot be inferred from results pages, ordinary JPZ/proof documents or archived supplemental-study requirements.",
    "Admission/source prose mixes2014/2019/2023/2025 rounds, six/eight-year grammar, distance/nastavba, current9th-grade programmes and third/fourth rounds. Review actual current eligible programme/year/round and scope; a scraped page existing is not current admissions evidence.",
    "School-fee prose mixes named programmes, monthly versus annual schedules, ranges, historic2023/24 values and broad same-for-all claims. Codex filtered212 records78000 while its prose gives76000-80000; this is an unsupported scalar candidate requiring exact-source review.212 is hidden in the reviewed ninth-grade scope snapshot, so this artifact does not establish current beta exposure.",
    "API filtered146 meal prose says heating food in a fridge/microwave; preserve the experiment output, but correct that certain wording if the same phrase is actually served today. Distinguish own canteen absence, school-arranged external meals and self-provided delivery/microwave before assigning a boolean.",
    "Ordinary subject choice/marketing individual approach, after-school clubs, obligatory curricular practice and graduates ability to lead clubs are different concepts. Generic university preparation is not a measured continuation percentage or guarantee of admission. Model text/field count changes do not validate scoring-relevant category assignments."
  ],
