    "Reconcile visible eligible schools first against current official programme/year/round/fee/meal sources and the actual currently served rows; mark stale/ambiguous as unknown. Check the existing S09/S10 affected-school candidates and15/94 missing-source exceptions; do not alter hidden historical choices or physical hidden rows.",
